   "subject": "Interacting with and testing Shiny apps using RSelenium",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have produced some introductory material on RSelenium.<br><br>The RSelenium splash page is at <a href=\"http://johndharrison.github.io/RSelenium/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://johndharrison.github.io/RSelenium/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0D6V_IEV7qkFf_gBGzURsc\">http://johndharrison.github.io/RSelenium/</a> and introduces the project.<br><br>The basic operation vignette is on Rpubs at <a href=\"http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/12843\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/12843&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pC2gJ7uTG_6LYIZVKOvHt\">http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/12843</a> .<br>The basic shinytesting vignette is on Rpubs at <a href=\"http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13408&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lzYwTl6eY0TiDT1Kl5j0G\">http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13408</a><br><br>Thanks for any feedback<br><br>John<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "SDE6zxzAFuMJ",
   "from": "John Harrison",
   "author": "a58a2a3609db3342",
   "date": "2014-03-10T18:09:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: Interacting with and testing Shiny apps using RSelenium",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>The first half of a vignette RSelenium: Driving OS/Browsers local and remote is now on Rpubs:<br><br><a href=\"http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13885\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13885&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RR3sUaLt0NH5BJ8WnYhtT\">http://rpubs.com/johndharrison/13885</a><br><br>It details how RSelenium can be used to control browsers on a local machine.<br><br><ol><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_xeNjpoZnv8fLXv9xxtEt\">RSelenium with local fully-fledged browsers.</a>\n\n<ul><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1aa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1aa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07CeF5fDbGkT9PI2oB-wa6\">Firefox.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tLKwcYeJ-2Jy8Mcd2fYGM\">Chrome.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1b&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zEaIRKZKVowe2TWU4LHTt\">Internet Explorer.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1c&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1h5HKmuiXBuI6kqhA0Tl1q\">Safari.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id1d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id1d&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Byqx36NbuC0Aq1be97IPf\">Opera.</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lIJAIdUDc-kJrTOA56fM2\">RSelenium with local headless browsers.</a>\n\n<ul><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id2a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id2a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YSCe2g4uN2S08Dte2X7c_\">PhantomJs.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id2b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id2b&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XVUWa_Im1Dl31-8cdzbhB\">HtmlUnit.</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rgjIZJoIptj2cdj260FOT\">RSelenium with local mobile browsers.</a>\n\n<ul><li><a href=\"http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html#id3a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio-pubs-static.s3.amazonaws.com/13885_189d962bee6b429d86831b699967f8dd.html%23id3a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401019576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XiWwoNZMSeq5mR0EZYcNw\">Android.</a></li></ul></li></ol>the second half will deal with controlling remote OS/browser combos on external websites and also on local websites (localhost - useful for testing a non-live app.)<br><br>Cheers<br><br>John<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
